              "summary": [
                "President Donald Trump and his top aides at the White House have begun their full-court press to try to discredit former FBI Director James Comey. In a new book, Comey compares Trump to a mob boss who insists on loyalty while twisting facts to boost his own ego. Trump tweeted Friday that Comey is an \"untruthful slime ball\" who should be prosecuted for leaking classified information. White House spokeswoman Sarah Huckabee Sanders added on Twitter that \"Comey has no credibility.\""
