              "summary": [
                "Arnold Schwarzenegger says he's good, but not great, following heart surgery. The 70-year-old \"Terminator\" actor and former California governor on Thursday released a short video on Twitter updating his condition and thanking people for the support. Schwarzenegger says he's feeling better, but he's \"not great yet.\" A pulmonic valve originally installed in 1997 for a congenital heart defect had to be replaced."
