              "summary": [
                "Bill Cosby's chief accuser is telling jurors at his sexual assault retrial that she's seeking justice. Andrea Constand began testifying Friday at the courthouse in suburban Philadelphia. She's getting a second chance to confront Cosby in court after his first trial ended with a hung jury. The defense team calls Constand a \"con artist\" who framed Cosby for money. Constand says she has nothing to gain financially now by wanting him locked up. She says Cosby drugged and molested her."
