              "summary": [
                "A spokesman for Bill Cosby says that once jurors hear the testimony of the comedian's chief accuser they should find him not guilty. Andrew Wyatt told reporters outside of a suburban Philadelphia courthouse Friday that accuser Andrea Constand will testify to \"alternative facts.\" She says he drugged and molested her, but Cosby says the relationship was consensual. Constand will take the stand Friday after five other women told the court that Cosby is a serial rapist who harmed them too."
