              "summary": [
                "\"This Is Us\" has been named outstanding television drama at the GLAAD Media Awards at a ceremony that also honored Britney Spears. The 29th annual ceremony held Thursday at the Beverly Hilton also recognized \"Master of None\" for an episode in which Lena Waithe's character comes out to her family. Ricky Martin bestowed Spears the group's Vanguard Award during Thursday's ceremony, the first of two that honor projects that feature multi-dimensional depictions of LGBTQ people."
